-- =============================================================================
--  The quiz questions (the owner's decision D37, stage 3)
-- =============================================================================
--
--  The rules quiz, from the technician agreement, and DRAFT safety quizzes for
--  the five trades with risky work: AC, Electrician, Plumber, Solar and Home
--  appliances. Ten are drawn at random from each pool every time.
--
--  This file switches NOTHING on. Every quiz stays off until the owner turns
--  it on in the office panel (First jobs), and:
--   - the Urdu of every question is a draft that a native speaker must check
--     first, as the project's rule on Urdu requires;
--   - a safety quiz is advice about safety: a qualified electrician, gas
--     fitter or AC technician must check its questions first, and
--     admin_set_quiz() refuses to switch one on without that person's name.
--  Nothing public mentions a safety test while they are off.
--
--  A question is changed by changing it here and running the file again: its
--  key stays the same, so attempts already made keep pointing at it.
--
--  Safe to run twice.
-- =============================================================================

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (qkey) DO UPDATE SET quiz = EXCLUDED.quiz, ur = EXCLUDED.ur, en = EXCLUDED.en,
  options = EXCLUDED.options, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, active = true;

VALUES ('20261113100000_quiz_questions')
ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;
